<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>What He is: He’s a God-man,</l><l>A divine and human God-man.</l><l>Living God as man, He paved the way</l><l>For God to live in me today.</l><l>He’s a God-man! Wonderful!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>What He is: He’s exalted.</l><l>He’s to God’s right hand exalted.</l><l>God was incarnated for His plan;</l><l>He lived, He died, He rose as man,</l><l>He’s exalted! Wonderful!</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>What He is: He’s our High Priest.</l><l>He’s our interceding High Priest,</l><l>Like us tempted, yet He’s without sin;</l><l>We boldly come to God through Him.</l><l>He’s our High Priest! Wonderful!</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>What He is: He’s within us.</l><l>He is living now within us.</l><l>As the Spirit He is saving me.</l><l>From now unto eternity,</l><l>He’s within us! Wonderful!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
